Somerset, Bristol, North Somerset, South Gloucestershire and the
West of England, from 2015/16 onward. The x-axis shows academic
year; the y-axis shows percentage, with each local authority shown
in a different colour. The West of England average has improved in
recent years, rising from around 68% in 2021/22 to almost 72% in
2024/25, with local authorities following a similar upward pattern.' width=672}
